- Read the P1 plan, principal specification, independent design PASS, task-reviewer template, and the package's `preimage-report.md`, `diff-hash-report.md`, `preservation-report.md`, and `static-checks.txt`. Final `task-report.md` and updated diff/hash/static reports were read before PASS.
